{"title":"For the First Time in Forever (Reprise)","artist":"Frozen","sourceId":"reference:kvWix35Yu7JQvmAM3jTz","sourceHash":"f2a83901eb255dd86bcced524a3f264369ae97030c156809d25125dd1d38ec6f","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.23,"end":3.23,"text":"You don't have to protect me, I'm not afraid","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":3.36,"end":5.55,"text":"Please don't shut me out again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":5.55,"end":7.65,"text":"Please don't slam the door","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":7.65,"end":10.65,"text":"You don't have to keep your distance anymore","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":11.8,"end":14.8,"text":"'Cause for the first time in forever","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":14.86,"end":16.81,"text":"I finally understand","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":16.81,"end":19.49,"text":"For the first time in forever","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":19.49,"end":21.66,"text":"We can fix this hand in hand","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":21.66,"end":23.98,"text":"We can head down this mountain together","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":23.98,"end":26.87,"text":"You don't have to live in fear","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":26.87,"end":29.87,"text":"'Cause for the first time in forever","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":31.22,"end":34.22,"text":"I will be right here","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":34.22,"end":37.22,"text":"Anna, please go back home","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":37.47,"end":39.96,"text":"Your life awaits","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":39.96,"end":41.24,"text":"Go enjoy the sun","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":41.24,"end":43.46,"text":"And open up the gates","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":43.46,"end":44.91,"text":"Yeah, but I know","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":44.91,"end":47.16,"text":"You mean well","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":47.16,"end":49.78,"text":"But leave me be","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":49.78,"end":52.78,"text":"Yes, I'm alone, but I'm alone and free","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":53.86,"end":56.86,"text":"Just stay away and you'll be safe from me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":59.75,"end":60.83,"text":"Actually we're not","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":60.83,"end":61.84,"text":"What do you mean you're not?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":61.84,"end":63.4,"text":"I get the feeling you don't know","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":63.4,"end":65.29,"text":"What do I not know?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":65.29,"end":68.29,"text":"Arendelle's in deep, deep, deep, deep snow","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":71.44,"end":72.59,"text":"What?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":72.59,"end":75.59,"text":"You kind of set off an eternal winter, everywhere","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":76.53,"end":77.68,"text":"Everywhere?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":77.68,"end":79.72,"text":"It's okay, you can just unfreeze it","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":79.72,"end":81.76,"text":"No, I can't, I, I don't know how","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":81.76,"end":84.45,"text":"Sure you can, I know you can","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":84.45,"end":86.86,"text":"'Cause for the first time in forever","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":86.86,"end":89.82,"text":"(Oh, I'm such a fool, I can't be free)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":89.82,"end":92.82,"text":"You don't have to be afraid","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":93.35,"end":94.93,"text":"(No escape from the storm inside of me)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":94.93,"end":97.92,"text":"We can work this out together","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":97.92,"end":99.94,"text":"(I can't control the curse)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":99.94,"end":101.2,"text":"We'll reverse the storm you've made","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":101.2,"end":104.2,"text":"(Oh, please, you'll only make it worse)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":106.4,"end":107.21000000000001,"text":"Don't panic","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":107.21000000000001,"end":108.02000000000001,"text":"(There's so much fear)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":108.02000000000001,"end":109.63,"text":"You'll make the sun shine bright","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":109.63,"end":111.28999999999999,"text":"(You're not safe here)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":111.28999999999999,"end":114.18,"text":"We can face this thing together","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":114.18,"end":116.67,"text":"We can change this thing together","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":116.67,"end":119.67,"text":"And everything will be alright!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":119.75,"end":122.75,"text":"(I can't!)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}